{"reviews":[{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-0","r":1.0,"t":"Don't do it!","x":"I normally buy this product from the hair salon and I'm upset that I didn't do it this time! When I received the product it had leaked all over the box and the bottle. Then when I finally got to the bottle of shampoo it is totally different than the product I get from the hair salon! It was watery and not as thick as it normally is. I will definitely stick to paying more money at the hair salon to make sure I get the right product.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-1","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"My hair is so soft and it smells amazing!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-2","r":4.0,"t":"the conditioner is awesome untangles hair in a breeze","x":"shampoo you just need a quarter size to lather. a little bit goes a long way. the conditioner is awesome untangles hair in a breeze. wished it had a bit of a scent of some sort.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-3","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Great product for color treated hair and for hair that is fine as it doesn't weigh hair down.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-4","r":5.0,"t":"Haircare","x":"Product works great on my hair and smells pretty","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-5","r":1.0,"t":"Wont buy again","x":"Didnt have to open them till to late to return. Shampoo is watery & no smell. Conditioner so thick I cant get it out of bottle. So thick & what I have been able to get out has no smell no effect.  For the expense $ wont but again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-6","r":2.0,"t":"Scent is not really great, and this makes my hair SO dry and ...","x":"I was really excited about this. Scent is not really great, and this makes my hair SO dry and frizzy... Going to use it here and there just to use it up, maybe even use it for my dog lol......will not be buying again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-7","r":4.0,"t":"Nice to find it again","x":"I found out about this brand from a nearby beauty school a little over a decade ago. It really helped to repair some of the over styling damage done to my hair. Nice to find it again. Hope it still works aswell.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-8","r":5.0,"t":"Love ordering shampoo and conditioner online and coming straight to ...","x":"Love ordering shampoo and conditioner online and coming straight to my door.  Decent price for the size of the bottles.  Nice scent; not too strong!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-9","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome fragrance","x":"This shampoo and conditioner is perfect for my color treated hair. Very protective and has the most wonderful fragrance!  Highly recommend!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-10","r":5.0,"t":"Good product!","x":"Like how smooth my hair is after using this with the smoothing gel. Nice to find a good shampoo / conditioner that isn't so expensive.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great shampoo and conditioner","x":"This is the only shampoo/conditioner line my salon uses, so I was very happy to find it available here at a more reasonable price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-12","r":1.0,"t":"Not Scruples","x":"Idk what this is, but it doesn\u2019t smell or feel like authentic Scruples.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-13","r":5.0,"t":"Recommended by my hair stylist","x":"My hair feels light not weighed down and styles better","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-14","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love this shampoo and conditioner, and smells great!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-15","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t Buy","x":"Dries your hair out and smells bad. Waste of money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-16","r":5.0,"t":"Best","x":"Best color retention shampoo and conditioner!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-17","r":1.0,"t":"Bottles leaked","x":"Bottles were unscrewed and leaked everywhere.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-18","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Bought both for my daughter. She loves them!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-19","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love the brand, makes my hair feel great.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-20","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"It works great for me and smells so good","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-21","r":5.0,"t":"Best shampoo ever","x":"I was introduced to this shampoo at a trade school class and wasn't able to find it locally anywhere! It lathers very well and rinses out nice leaving my colors vibrant and soft, yet manageable. The conditioner is good too and I get compliments frequently on how nice my hair smells. Makes you feel great!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-22","r":5.0,"t":"leaves hair soft and manageable smells great!","x":"Love scruples! iv been using this for years smells amazing and my hair feels lightweight and unlike my other shampoos iv used scruples is the only shampoo and conditioner that makes my scalp feel clean and not have build up from other shampoos...my older kids use it to worth the money!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-23","r":5.0,"t":"Scruples as good as it is in salon large bottle!","x":"Bought this for my Mom it is the shampoo and conditioner that they use on her hair in the salon she goes to. She loves it and is very happy I bought it on Amazon. We couldn't find the duo in retail shops. And salon didn't carry for some strange reason. Mom said her hair feels great!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B00NCBX6AK-24","r":1.0,"t":"Product opened.","x":"Ordered these as they were much cheaper online, however the conditioner bottle got opened up (I\u2019m assuming by the mail) and it was everywhere in the box. The plastic had even split open. Therefore I am only able to use the shampoo and the little bit left of the conditioner.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers love the scent, describing it as nice, great, or not too strong.","cites":[2,5,9,10,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say it leaves hair soft, smooth, and not weighed down, especially for color-treated or fine hair.","cites":[2,4,11,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain the shampoo is watery and/or the product lacks scent, with a few suspecting it isn't authentic.","cites":[1,6,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers report negative results like dry, frizzy hair or conditioner too thick to dispense.","cites":[6,7]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers praise the value and convenience of buying it online at a reasonable price.","cites":[9,11,12]}]},"qa":[]}